<concept id="about-remediation-fencing-maintenance-far">
  <title>Fence Agents Remediation Operator</title>
  <shortdesc>The Fence Agents Remediation (FAR) Operator is a Red Hat OpenShift add-on Operator. The Operator automatically remediates unhealthy nodes, similar to the Self Node Remediation Operator. You can use well-known agents to fence and remediate unhealthy nodes.</shortdesc>
  <conbody>
    <p>FAR supports two fencing actions 1) the <codeph>reboot</codeph> action - used with any agent or 2) the <codeph>off</codeph> action - only used with cloud-based agents. The remediation includes rebooting the unhealthy node using a fence agent, and then evicting workloads from the unhealthy node, depending on the remediation strategy.</p>
  </conbody>
